     Error_GenericLoad], Error_AddToCartFailed [aliased from
     Error_GenericAdd], MyPurchaseLimitHint), plus the MobileProducts-
     shared budget/add-button/stock/toman/toast keys (BudgetRemaining,
     BudgetUsed, NoBudget, TomanUnit, OutOfStock, LowStock, InStock,
     AddButtonReadOnly[Title], AddButtonLimitReached[Title],
     AddButtonSalaryReached[Title], AddButtonStockOut[Title],
     ToastQtyMin, ToastLimitReached, ToastQtyClamped, ToastSalaryReached),
     plus mobile-only keys (BackToProducts, ProductNotFound, NoCategory,
     RetryButton, AddedToCart, AddedToCartTitle, Error_Unexpected,
     Error_FailedToLoad, Error_AddToCartFailed, Version).

     The four <resheader> tags below are REQUIRED by the .resx reader —
     without them, the loader rejects the file with "resx input is not
     valid, couldn't find valid resheader tags". -->
